<section class="baseline-panel" aria-labelledby="baseline-title">
    <header>
        <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">Current pot setup</p>
            <h2 id="baseline-title">Dry/wet weight baseline</h2>
            <p>
                The averages use only the active pot setup. A baseline becomes ready after at least
                two dry and two wet readings.
            </p>
        </div>
        <span class="status-badge" id="baseline-status">
            Waiting for data
        </span>
    </header>
    <div class="baseline-grid">
        <article>
            <span>Pot setup</span>
            <strong id="pot-setup">1</strong>
            <small>Increment after repotting</small>
        </article>
        <article>
            <span>Dry average</span>
            <strong id="dry-average">—</strong>
            <small id="dry-samples">0 samples</small>
        </article>
        <article>
            <span>Wet average</span>
            <strong id="wet-average">—</strong>
            <small id="wet-samples">0 samples</small>
        </article>
        <article>
            <span>Water capacity</span>
            <strong id="water-capacity">—</strong>
            <small>Wet average minus dry average</small>
        </article>
        <article>
            <span>Estimated water remaining</span>
            <strong id="water-remaining">—</strong>
            <small>Only shown after a usable baseline</small>
        </article>
    </div>
    <p class="baseline-note">
        Read the weight trend alongside plant firmness, moisture in the mix, and recent growth.
    </p>
</section>
